{"page":461,"verses":[{"verse_key":"39:22","surah":39,"ayah":22,"ar_uthmani":"أَفَمَن شَرَحَ ٱللَّهُ صَدْرَهُۥ لِلْإِسْلَـٰمِ فَهُوَ عَلَىٰ نُورٍ مِّن رَّبِّهِۦ ۚ فَوَيْلٌ لِّلْقَـٰسِيَةِ قُلُوبُهُم مِّن ذِكْرِ ٱللَّهِ ۚ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ فِى ضَلَـٰلٍ مُّبِينٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"What about the one whose heart God has opened in devotion to Him, so that he walks in light from his Lord? Alas for those whose hearts harden at the mention of God! They have clearly lost their way.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَفَمَن","en_gloss":"So is (one for) whom","transliteration":"afaman","verse_key":"39:22"},{"pos":2,"ar":"شَرَحَ","en_gloss":"Allah has expanded","transliteration":"sharaḥa","verse_key":"39:22"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah has expanded","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"39:22"},{"pos":4,"ar":"صَدْرَهُۥ","en_gloss":"his breast","transliteration":"ṣadrahu","verse_key":"39:22"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لِلْإِسْلَـٰمِ","en_gloss":"for Islam","transliteration":"lil'is'lāmi","verse_key":"39:22"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَهُوَ","en_gloss":"so he","transliteration":"fahuwa","verse_key":"39:22"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"(is) upon","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"39:22"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نُورٍۢ","en_gloss":"a light","transliteration":"nūrin","verse_key":"39:22"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"39:22"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رَّبِّهِۦ ۚ","en_gloss":"his Lord","transliteration":"rabbihi","verse_key":"39:22"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَوَيْلٌۭ","en_gloss":"So woe","transliteration":"fawaylun","verse_key":"39:22"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لِّلْقَـٰسِيَةِ","en_gloss":"to (those are) hardened","transliteration":"lil'qāsiyati","verse_key":"39:22"},{"pos":13,"ar":"قُلُوبُهُم","en_gloss":"their hearts","transliteration":"qulūbuhum","verse_key":"39:22"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"39:22"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ذِكْرِ","en_gloss":"(the) remembrance of Allah","transliteration":"dhik'ri","verse_key":"39:22"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(the) remembrance of Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"39:22"},{"pos":17,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"39:22"},{"pos":18,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(are) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"39:22"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ضَلَـٰلٍۢ","en_gloss":"error","transliteration":"ḍalālin","verse_key":"39:22"},{"pos":20,"ar":"مُّبِينٍ","en_gloss":"clear","transliteration":"mubīnin","verse_key":"39:22"},{"pos":21,"ar":"٢٢","en_gloss":"(22)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"39:22"}]},{"verse_key":"39:23","surah":39,"ayah":23,"ar_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ نَزَّلَ أَحْسَنَ ٱلْحَدِيثِ كِتَـٰبًا مُّتَشَـٰبِهًا مَّثَانِىَ تَقْشَعِرُّ مِنْهُ جُلُودُ ٱلَّذِينَ يَخْشَوْنَ رَبَّهُمْ ثُمَّ تَلِينُ جُلُودُهُمْ وَقُلُوبُهُمْ إِلَىٰ ذِكْرِ ٱللَّهِ ۚ ذَٰلِكَ هُدَى ٱللَّهِ يَهْدِى بِهِۦ مَن يَشَآءُ ۚ وَمَن يُضْلِلِ ٱللَّهُ فَمَا لَهُۥ مِنْ هَادٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God has sent down the most beautiful of all teachings: a Scripture that is consistent and draws comparisons; that causes the skins of those in awe of their Lord to shiver. Then their skins and their hearts soften at the mention of God: such is God’s guidance. He guides with it whoever He will; no one can guide those God leaves to stray.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"al-lahu","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نَزَّلَ","en_gloss":"has revealed","transliteration":"nazzala","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَحْسَنَ","en_gloss":"(the) best","transliteration":"aḥsana","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْحَدِيثِ","en_gloss":"(of) [the] statement ","transliteration":"l-ḥadīthi","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كِتَـٰبًۭا","en_gloss":"a Book","transliteration":"kitāban","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مُّتَشَـٰبِهًۭا","en_gloss":"(its parts) resembling each other","transliteration":"mutashābihan","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَّثَانِىَ","en_gloss":"oft-repeated","transliteration":"mathāniya","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَقْشَعِرُّ","en_gloss":"Shiver","transliteration":"taqshaʿirru","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِنْهُ","en_gloss":"from it","transliteration":"min'hu","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":10,"ar":"جُلُودُ","en_gloss":"(the) skins","transliteration":"julūdu","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَخْشَوْنَ","en_gloss":"fear","transliteration":"yakhshawna","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":13,"ar":"رَبَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"their Lord","transliteration":"rabbahum","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":15,"ar":"تَلِينُ","en_gloss":"relax","transliteration":"talīnu","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":16,"ar":"جُلُودُهُمْ","en_gloss":"their skins","transliteration":"julūduhum","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَقُلُوبُهُمْ","en_gloss":"and their hearts","transliteration":"waqulūbuhum","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":18,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"at","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ذِكْرِ","en_gloss":"(the) remembrance","transliteration":"dhik'ri","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":20,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":22,"ar":"هُدَى","en_gloss":"(is the) guidance","transliteration":"hudā","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":23,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":24,"ar":"يَهْدِى","en_gloss":"He guides","transliteration":"yahdī","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":25,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"with it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":26,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":27,"ar":"يَشَآءُ ۚ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yashāu","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":28,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":29,"ar":"يُضْلِلِ","en_gloss":"Allah lets go astray","transliteration":"yuḍ'lili","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":30,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah lets go astray","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":31,"ar":"فَمَا","en_gloss":"then not","transliteration":"famā","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":32,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"for him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":33,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":34,"ar":"هَادٍ","en_gloss":"guide","transliteration":"hādin","verse_key":"39:23"},{"pos":35,"ar":"٢٣","en_gloss":"(23)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"39:23"}]},{"verse_key":"39:24","surah":39,"ayah":24,"ar_uthmani":"أَفَمَن يَتَّقِى بِوَجْهِهِۦ سُوٓءَ ٱلْعَذَابِ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۚ وَقِيلَ لِلظَّـٰلِمِينَ ذُوقُوا۟ مَا كُنتُمْ تَكْسِبُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"What about the one who will only have his bare face to protect him from his terrible suffering on the Day of Resurrection? It will be said to the evildoers, ‘Taste what you have earned.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَفَمَن","en_gloss":"Then (is) he who","transliteration":"afaman","verse_key":"39:24"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَتَّقِى","en_gloss":"will shield","transliteration":"yattaqī","verse_key":"39:24"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِوَجْهِهِۦ","en_gloss":"with his face","transliteration":"biwajhihi","verse_key":"39:24"},{"pos":4,"ar":"سُوٓءَ","en_gloss":"(the) worst","transliteration":"sūa","verse_key":"39:24"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابِ","en_gloss":"punishment","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābi","verse_key":"39:24"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(on the) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"39:24"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) the Resurrection","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","verse_key":"39:24"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَقِيلَ","en_gloss":"And it will be said","transliteration":"waqīla","verse_key":"39:24"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لِلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_gloss":"to the wrongdoers","transliteration":"lilẓẓālimīna","verse_key":"39:24"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ذُوقُوا۟","en_gloss":"Taste","transliteration":"dhūqū","verse_key":"39:24"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"39:24"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you used to","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"39:24"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَكْسِبُونَ","en_gloss":"earn","transliteration":"taksibūna","verse_key":"39:24"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٢٤","en_gloss":"(24)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"39:24"}]},{"verse_key":"39:25","surah":39,"ayah":25,"ar_uthmani":"كَذَّبَ ٱلَّذِينَ مِن قَبْلِهِمْ فَأَتَىٰهُمُ ٱلْعَذَابُ مِنْ حَيْثُ لَا يَشْعُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Others before them also disbelieved, and the punishment fell on them unawares:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"كَذَّبَ","en_gloss":"Denied","transliteration":"kadhaba","verse_key":"39:25"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"39:25"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"(were) before them","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"39:25"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَبْلِهِمْ","en_gloss":"(were) before them","transliteration":"qablihim","verse_key":"39:25"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَأَتَىٰهُمُ","en_gloss":"so came upon them","transliteration":"fa-atāhumu","verse_key":"39:25"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابُ","en_gloss":"the punishment","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābu","verse_key":"39:25"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"39:25"},{"pos":8,"ar":"حَيْثُ","en_gloss":"where","transliteration":"ḥaythu","verse_key":"39:25"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"39:25"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَشْعُرُونَ","en_gloss":"they perceive","transliteration":"yashʿurūna","verse_key":"39:25"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٢٥","en_gloss":"(25)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"39:25"}]},{"verse_key":"39:26","surah":39,"ayah":26,"ar_uthmani":"فَأَذَاقَهُمُ ٱللَّهُ ٱلْخِزْىَ فِى ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا ۖ وَلَعَذَابُ ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ أَكْبَرُ ۚ لَوْ كَانُوا۟ يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God gave them the punishment of disgrace in this world to taste; the punishment will be even harder in the Hereafter, if only they knew.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَأَذَاقَهُمُ","en_gloss":"So Allah made them","transliteration":"fa-adhāqahumu","verse_key":"39:26"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"So Allah made them","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"39:26"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْخِزْىَ","en_gloss":"the disgrace","transliteration":"l-khiz'ya","verse_key":"39:26"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"39:26"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","en_gloss":"the life","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","verse_key":"39:26"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا ۖ","en_gloss":"(of) the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"39:26"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلَعَذَابُ","en_gloss":"and certainly (the) punishment","transliteration":"walaʿadhābu","verse_key":"39:26"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Hereafter","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","verse_key":"39:26"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَكْبَرُ ۚ","en_gloss":"(is) greater","transliteration":"akbaru","verse_key":"39:26"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَوْ","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"law","verse_key":"39:26"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"39:26"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"knew","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","verse_key":"39:26"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٢٦","en_gloss":"(26)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"39:26"}]},{"verse_key":"39:27","surah":39,"ayah":27,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ ضَرَبْنَا لِلنَّاسِ فِى هَـٰذَا ٱلْقُرْءَانِ مِن كُلِّ مَثَلٍ لَّعَلَّهُمْ يَتَذَكَّرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"In this Quran, We have put forward all kinds of illustration for people, so that they may take heed-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"39:27"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ضَرَبْنَا","en_gloss":"We have set forth","transliteration":"ḍarabnā","verse_key":"39:27"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"for people","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","verse_key":"39:27"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"39:27"},{"pos":5,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"this","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"39:27"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْقُرْءَانِ","en_gloss":"Quran","transliteration":"l-qur'āni","verse_key":"39:27"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"39:27"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"39:27"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَثَلٍۢ","en_gloss":"example","transliteration":"mathalin","verse_key":"39:27"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَّعَلَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"so that they may","transliteration":"laʿallahum","verse_key":"39:27"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَتَذَكَّرُونَ","en_gloss":"take heed","transliteration":"yatadhakkarūna","verse_key":"39:27"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٢٧","en_gloss":"(27)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"39:27"}]},{"verse_key":"39:28","surah":39,"ayah":28,"ar_uthmani":"قُرْءَانًا عَرَبِيًّا غَيْرَ ذِى عِوَجٍ لَّعَلَّهُمْ يَتَّقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"an Arabic Quran, free from any distortion- so that people may be mindful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُرْءَانًا","en_gloss":"A Quran","transliteration":"qur'ānan","verse_key":"39:28"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَرَبِيًّا","en_gloss":"(in) Arabic","transliteration":"ʿarabiyyan","verse_key":"39:28"},{"pos":3,"ar":"غَيْرَ","en_gloss":"without","transliteration":"ghayra","verse_key":"39:28"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ذِى","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"dhī","verse_key":"39:28"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عِوَجٍۢ","en_gloss":"crookedness","transliteration":"ʿiwajin","verse_key":"39:28"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَّعَلَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"so that they may","transliteration":"laʿallahum","verse_key":"39:28"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَتَّقُونَ","en_gloss":"(become) righteous","transliteration":"yattaqūna","verse_key":"39:28"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٢٨","en_gloss":"(28)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"39:28"}]},{"verse_key":"39:29","surah":39,"ayah":29,"ar_uthmani":"ضَرَبَ ٱللَّهُ مَثَلًا رَّجُلًا فِيهِ شُرَكَآءُ مُتَشَـٰكِسُونَ وَرَجُلًا سَلَمًا لِّرَجُلٍ هَلْ يَسْتَوِيَانِ مَثَلًا ۚ ٱلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ ۚ بَلْ أَكْثَرُهُمْ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God puts forward this illustration: can a man who has for his masters several partners at odds with each other be considered equal to a man devoted wholly to one master? All praise belongs to God, though most of them do not know.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ضَرَبَ","en_gloss":"Allah sets forth","transliteration":"ḍaraba","verse_key":"39:29"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah sets forth","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"39:29"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَثَلًۭا","en_gloss":"an example ","transliteration":"mathalan","verse_key":"39:29"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَّجُلًۭا","en_gloss":"a man","transliteration":"rajulan","verse_key":"39:29"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"about him","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"39:29"},{"pos":6,"ar":"شُرَكَآءُ","en_gloss":"partners","transliteration":"shurakāu","verse_key":"39:29"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مُتَشَـٰكِسُونَ","en_gloss":"quarreling","transliteration":"mutashākisūna","verse_key":"39:29"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَرَجُلًۭا","en_gloss":"and a man","transliteration":"warajulan","verse_key":"39:29"},{"pos":9,"ar":"سَلَمًۭا","en_gloss":"(belonging) exclusively","transliteration":"salaman","verse_key":"39:29"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لِّرَجُلٍ","en_gloss":"to one man ","transliteration":"lirajulin","verse_key":"39:29"},{"pos":11,"ar":"هَلْ","en_gloss":"are","transliteration":"hal","verse_key":"39:29"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَسْتَوِيَانِ","en_gloss":"they both equal","transliteration":"yastawiyāni","verse_key":"39:29"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَثَلًا ۚ","en_gloss":"(in) comparison","transliteration":"mathalan","verse_key":"39:29"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْحَمْدُ","en_gloss":"All praise","transliteration":"l-ḥamdu","verse_key":"39:29"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لِلَّهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(be) to Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"39:29"},{"pos":16,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss